# --------------------- exg swiswi options ---------------------
# flopy multi-package

block options
name print_input
type keyword
reader urword
optional true
longname keyword to print input to list file
description keyword to indicate that the list of exchange entries will be echoed to the listing file immediately after it is read.
mf6internal ipr_input

block options
name print_flows
type keyword
reader urword
optional true
longname keyword to print swiswi flows to list file
description keyword to indicate that the list of exchange flow rates will be printed to the listing file for every stress period in which ``SAVE BUDGET'' is specified in Output Control.
mf6internal ipr_flow


block options
name dev_no_cross_storage
type keyword
reader urword
optional true
longname disable cross-fluid storage newton terms
description keyword to disable the cross-fluid storage Newton (Jacobian) terms in the SWI-SWI exchange.  This is a developer option for diagnosing convergence.  These terms cancel at convergence, so disabling them does not change the converged solution, but it may slow or prevent convergence.
mf6internal inocrossstorage

block options
name dev_no_cross_flow
type keyword
reader urword
optional true
longname disable cross-fluid flow newton terms
description keyword to disable the cross-fluid flow Newton (Jacobian) terms in the SWI-SWI exchange.  This is a developer option for diagnosing convergence.  These terms cancel at convergence, so disabling them does not change the converged solution, but it may slow or prevent convergence.
mf6internal inocrossflow
